header: "---\nname: jake-x-x-comment\ndescription: \"Write replies on other people's X posts and threads that read as a person with something to add, not a reply guy. Use when the user pastes a post and wants a reply, says \\\"reply to this\\\", \\\"comment on this thread\\\", \\\"engage with this\\\", \\\"what do I say here\\\", \\\"quote tweet this\\\", or wants a batch of replies for their daily engagement round.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/x-agent-skill\n  upstream_skill: x-comment\n  upstream_commit: 7822c29b4aedbd400b9339839d3f59f3652b1317\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
